---
---

<section class="help-section">
  <div class="help-header brutalist-block">
    <span class="help-badge">DOCUMENTATION</span>
    <h2 class="help-title">NEW TO GAME THEORY?</h2>
    <p class="help-subtitle">
      Access foundational resources to understand the mechanics of game theory
      and rational decision making.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="video-grid">
    <a
      class="video-card brutalist-block"
      href="https://youtu.be/3Y1WpytiHKE?si=hAzkLdrZea102V4T"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
    >
      <div class="video-tag">[ 4 MIN ]</div>
      <div class="video-icon"><div class="play-triangle"></div></div>
      <h3 class="video-title">Introduction to Game Theory</h3>
      <p class="video-desc">What is game theory and why does it matter?</p>
    </a>

    <a
      class="video-card brutalist-block"
      href="https://youtu.be/t9Lo2fgxWHw?si=GikX2THhcJvzZjRU"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
    >
      <div class="video-tag">[ 6 MIN ]</div>
      <div class="video-icon"><div class="play-triangle"></div></div>
      <h3 class="video-title">The Prisoner's Dilemma</h3>
      <p class="video-desc">Payoff matrices and rational thinking basics.</p>
    </a>

    <a
      class="video-card brutalist-block"
      href="https://youtu.be/mScpHTIi-kM?si=vkVr1xUnCcgBNDpz"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
    >
      <div class="video-tag accent-tag">[ 28 MIN ]</div>
      <div class="video-icon"><div class="play-triangle"></div></div>
      <h3 class="video-title">Axelrod's Tournament</h3>
      <p class="video-desc">The historical simulation that inspired ITERON.</p>
    </a>
  </div>

  <div class="contact-footer brutalist-block">
    <p>For any questions or queries, reach out at:</p>
    <a href="mailto:iteron.iiserm@gmail.com" class="contact-email"
      >iteron.iiserm@gmail.com</a
    >
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .help-section {
    padding: 8rem 5%;
    max-width: 1400px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .help-header {
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--accent-purple);
    background: transparent;
    padding: 0;
    box-shadow: none;
    border: none;
  }

  .help-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--accent-purple);
    color: #000;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .help-title {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    color: var(--text-white);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .help-subtitle {
    color: #8d96b2;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  .video-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 6rem;
  }

  .video-card {
    position: relative;
    padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem;
    background: #000;
    transition: all 0.2s;
    text-decoration: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .video-card:hover {
    transform: translate(-4px, -4px);
    box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 var(--text-white);
    background: var(--accent-purple);
  }

  .video-card:hover .video-title,
  .video-card:hover .video-desc {
    color: #000;
  }

  .video-card:hover .video-icon {
    border-color: #000;
  }

  .video-card:hover .play-triangle {
    border-left-color: #000;
  }

  .video-tag {
    position: absolute;
    top: -12px;
    left: -1px;
    background: var(--text-white);
    color: #000;
    font-weight: bold;
    padding: 2px 8px;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
  }

  .accent-tag {
    background: var(--accent-purple);
    border-color: var(--accent-purple);
  }

  .video-icon {
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    border: 2px solid var(--accent-purple);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .play-triangle {
    width: 0;
    height: 0;
    border-top: 8px solid transparent;
    border-bottom: 8px solid transparent;
    border-left: 14px solid var(--accent-purple);
    margin-left: 4px;
  }

  .video-title {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--text-white);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .video-desc {
    color: #a0a0a0;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .contact-footer {
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
    border-color: var(--accent-purple);
  }

  .contact-footer p {
    color: #a0a0a0;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  .contact-email {
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
  }

  footer {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    padding: 3rem 2rem;
    border-top: 2px solid var(--grid-color);
    color: #666;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
  }

  .footer-logo {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .turing-logo-img {
    height: 60px;
    width: auto;
    object-fit: contain;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 0 5px rgba(186, 143, 216, 0.3));
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }

  .turing-logo-img:hover {
    transform: scale(1.05);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .help-section {
      padding: 5.5rem 1.25rem;
    }

    .help-header {
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
    }

    .help-title {
      font-size: 1.8rem;
    }

    .help-subtitle {
      font-size: 1rem;
    }

    .video-card {
      padding: 1.9rem 1.2rem;
    }

    .contact-email {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      word-break: break-word;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .video-grid {
      gap: 1.6rem;
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
    }

    .video-title {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
    }

    .video-desc {
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }
  }
</style>
